792236_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eznzijX0IOIQ7kNvwERBJsW&_nc_oc=AdoD0z9mmfyzlb8dBCMGNE_w8VEl9uZSm_F9VBT2C2OBxaO1n5tGyevJhFpisX9huaY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_3OXn6Fklxx1ML03AcAVGaMD5FSgxUDKfTsIXGddi6MA&oe=6A32B758"}, {"file_name": "WhatsApp Image 2026-05-25 at 07.47.27 (4).png", "id": "1745046990199300", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/585819904_1745046993532633_9080284300547824683_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8QCx0GHnUqQQ7kNvwH45zmc&_nc_oc=AdqwJDtR1FyX3T_HWA4E00n0gtbAlUlyPiNIIPvMaJfXJ1CcMUoB2XHtLObVWHMTyVY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8TCcjvpDFF6BMGvyddOpvwKZreuRizzqZ7qrc_ZwuQQQ&oe=6A32911C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "BioSignals", "keywords": [], "long_description": "BioSignals for Meta Quest is a professional immersive biofeedback training application designed to bring physiological awareness, relaxation training, and emotional self-regulation into virtual reality.\n\nThe app works with compatible BioSignals sensors to display real-time body responses such as heart activity, heart-rate variability, skin conductance, breathing patterns, and stress-related changes. Instead of showing only numbers on a screen, BioSignals transforms the user\u2019s physiological state into interactive VR feedback, allowing the user to see, feel, and understand how the body responds during training.\n\nUsers can enter calming virtual environments and practice guided breathing, relaxation, focus, recovery, and self-control exercises. As the user becomes calmer and more regulated, the VR experience can respond visually and dynamically, creating a powerful connection between the body, the mind, and the surrounding environment.\n\nBioSignals is suitable for wellness training, stress management, education, research demonstrations, and professional biofeedback practice. It can be used by individuals at home or by therapists, coaches, clinics, and training centers as part of a guided intervention.\n\nThe goal of the app is to make biofeedback more engaging, intuitive, and motivating by combining scientifically inspired physiological monitoring with the emotional power of immersive VR.\n\nBioSignals does not replace medical diagnosis or treatment. It is intended for training", "short_description": "BioSignals for Meta Quest turns biofeedback training into an immersive VR experience. Connect compatible BioSignals sensors and practice guided relaxation, breathing, focus, and emotional self-regulation in calming virtual environments. The app helps users visualize physiological changes in real time and improve awareness through interactive training sessions. Designed for wellness, education, and professional biofeedback practice."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.biosignalsedu.com/privacy-policy/index.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "BIO SIGNALS ISRAEL LTD", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.biosignals.co.il/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25477115688629014"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604382710_1334377811947598_4543165768448355941_n.png?stp=